# Overzealous Muscle: "Whenever you commit a crime during your turn, this creature gains indestructible until end of turn."
# Bot1 casts Muscle (Black Lotus + two Moxes pay the {4}{B}), then on turn 3 bolts Bot2 (a crime, CR 700.13). The trigger
# resolves above the Bolt, so Bot2's Go for the Throat in response does not destroy Muscle (CR 702.12b). The effect ends at the
# cleanup step (CR 514.2): on turn 4 Bot2's second Go for the Throat destroys it.

